      "content": "idk i'm just really tired of driving to the clinic and waiting for hours... it's always just a bunch of tests that end up being normal anyway. do u think it could just be because i'm dehydrated or maybe low on magnesium? could i just try like some electrolytes and more rest for a week and see if it goes away before i bother a doctor?",
